	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.hello1">Arr, ye've the look of a landlubber what wants to catch somethin'!</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.hello2">Yo ho! Bait an' rods, matey. Best on this here coast, I swear it on me peg.</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.hello3">Shiver me timbers, a customer! Sit a spell on me fine vessel.</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.hello4">The sea gives up her treasures to them with proper bait, savvy?</string>
	<string name="hwp.fishing.pirate.hello5">Aye, she's sunk, but she's MY ship. Now, what'll it be?</string>
